      "chunkIndex": 3,
      "contentPreview": "THE ALIASING INVARIANT, and what would break it. LoadIndex hands out a live view of _indexCache[scope].Entries. That is safe ONLY because: (a) CachedIndex.NameToPosition, Rebuild() and GetOrComputeCorpusStats() have ZERO readers anywhere in the repo, so there is no derived structure to desync; (b) every cache write REPLACES the whole CachedIndex rather than mutating an existing Entries list \u2014 verified at FileMemoryStore.cs:679, 952, 979, 1007, 1050, with removals at :408 and :776; (c) exactly on",
